    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/0ad713ec225c80735941037949393e8e.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Description of Idle Farm Tycoon** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game overview:** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Farm Tycoon is an engaging and addictive simulation game in which players take on the role of a farmer who builds and manages their own farm. The goal is to create a thriving agricultural business by growing crops, raising animals, and making strategic investments. The game combines idle gameplay with tycoon elements, allowing players to enjoy their farm both actively and passively. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Idle Farm Tycoon, you start with a small plot of land and a few basic crops. As you progress, you can plant different types of crops, such as wheat, corn, and vegetables, and sell them for profit. The income you generate can be invested in upgrades to your farm, such as better equipment, more land, and hiring workers to automatically complete tasks for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/cc1ff4f58f333bedfbd3984440272895.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Crop management: Plant and harvest different crops to increase your income. Each crop has its own growth cycle and selling price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Animal Breeding: Expand your farm to include animals such as cows, sheep, and chickens. These animals produce valuable products such as milk, wool and eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/d0fade506d8e4d645286f7462c839a55.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Automation: Hire workers to run your farm while you're offline. This will ensure that your earnings keep coming in even if you're not actively playing the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Upgrades and Investments: Use your earned money to purchase upgrades that improve the efficiency of your farm. Think of faster harvesters, better seeds and more land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/27563a8216215ce1551c141d23320ef2.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Events and Missions: Participate in special events and complete missions to earn additional rewards and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Visual and Sound Effects: Enjoy colorful graphics and relaxing sound effects that bring the farm experience to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Target audience:** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Farm Tycoon is suitable for players of all ages who enjoy simulation and tycoon games. It offers a relaxed gameplay experience that is perfect for short play sessions or longer play times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Conclusion:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Idle Farm Tycoon offers a unique blend of strategy, management, and idle gameplay. With its charming graphics and addictive mechanics, it's an ideal choice for anyone who dreams of running a successful farm. Start building your agricultural empire today and watch your farm grow from a small plot of land to a thriving business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/0ad713ec225c80735941037949393e8e.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Description of Idle Farm Tycoon** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game overview:** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Farm Tycoon is an engaging and addictive simulation game in which players take on the role of a farmer who builds and manages their own farm. The goal is to create a thriving agricultural business by growing crops, raising animals, and making strategic investments. The game combines idle gameplay with tycoon elements, allowing players to enjoy their farm both actively and passively. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Idle Farm Tycoon, you start with a small plot of land and a few basic crops. As you progress, you can plant different types of crops, such as wheat, corn, and vegetables, and sell them for profit. The income you generate can be invested in upgrades to your farm, such as better equipment, more land, and hiring workers to automatically complete tasks for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/cc1ff4f58f333bedfbd3984440272895.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Crop management: Plant and harvest different crops to increase your income. Each crop has its own growth cycle and selling price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Animal Breeding: Expand your farm to include animals such as cows, sheep, and chickens. These animals produce valuable products such as milk, wool and eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/d0fade506d8e4d645286f7462c839a55.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Automation: Hire workers to run your farm while you're offline. This will ensure that your earnings keep coming in even if you're not actively playing the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Upgrades and Investments: Use your earned money to purchase upgrades that improve the efficiency of your farm. Think of faster harvesters, better seeds and more land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503280/extras/27563a8216215ce1551c141d23320ef2.avif?t=1748451078\" width=598 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Events and Missions: Participate in special events and complete missions to earn additional rewards and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Visual and Sound Effects: Enjoy colorful graphics and relaxing sound effects that bring the farm experience to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Target audience:** </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Farm Tycoon is suitable for players of all ages who enjoy simulation and tycoon games. It offers a relaxed gameplay experience that is perfect for short play sessions or longer play times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Conclusion:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Idle Farm Tycoon offers a unique blend of strategy, management, and idle gameplay. With its charming graphics and addictive mechanics, it's an ideal choice for anyone who dreams of running a successful farm. Start building your agricultural empire today and watch your farm grow from a small plot of land to a thriving business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
